  "title": "Cadrenal Therapeutics’ Late-Breaking Phase 2 Data Demonstrate Greater Than 25% Reduction in Thrombotic Events in HIT for First-in-Class 12-LOX Inhibitor CAD-1005 at ISTH 2026 Congress",
